# Store text files with LF in the repository and check them out with LF,
# whatever core.autocrlf says on each machine. Keeps generated outputs (MJML -> HTML)
# byte-identical across Windows, macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.xpt binary
